    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An excellent opportunity to acquire a well-positioned two-bedroom, one-bathroom top floor apartment in the heart of Dublin 8. Offering bright and well-proportioned accommodation, this attractive property is ideally suited to first-time buyers, investors, or those looking for a convenient city home.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a spacious living and dining area, a well-appointed kitchen, two comfortable bedrooms, and a main bathroom. The top floor position provides excellent privacy and a pleasant outlook, while the inclusion of secure designated parking is a valuable benefit in this sought-after city location. New flooring throughout the apartment along with a fresh lick of paint throughout. \r\n\r\nSituated within easy reach of Dublin City Centre, the property is surrounded by a wealth of amenities including cafés, restaurants, shops, parks, and leisure facilities. The area is exceptionally well served by public transport, with numerous bus routes and Luas connections nearby, providing easy access to the city and surrounding areas.\r\n\r\nWith its generous accommodation, secure parking, and superb Dublin 8 location, this property represents an excellent opportunity and is sure to appeal to a wide range of buyers.\r\n\r\nBER: 106901580"
      },
